  "body": "This test-case behaves inconsistently. One button light-dismisses the popover on mouse up and another one doesn't.\n\nI think both should behave consistently (ideally not light-dismissing on mouseup?).\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<button onmousedown=\"p.showPopover({ source: this })\">\n  Foo\n</button>\n<button commandfor=\"p\" onmousedown=\"p.showPopover({ source: this })\">\n  Foo 2\n</button>\n<div popover=\"auto\" id=\"p\">Bar</div>\n```\n\nThis came up during the customizable select implementation in Gecko.\n\ncc @keithamus @annevk @josepharhar ",
